=12\\,000.$\n\nTherefore, the value $A$ at time $t$ is\n\n$$\nA(t)=12\\,000\\,{e}^{kt}.\n$$\n\nFinally, to find the value of $k,$ we substitute $A(4)=15\\,000$ into the equation above and solve for $k,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A(4) & =12\\,000\\,{e}^{k\\cdot 4} \\\\ 15\\,000 & =12\\,000\\,{e}^{4k} \\\\ {e}^{4k} & =\\frac{15\\,000}{12\\,000} \\\\ {e}^{4k} & =1.25 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{4k}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1.25) \\\\ 4k & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1.25) \\\\ k & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1.25) \\\\ k & =0.055\\,78…\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k≈6%,$ rounded to the nearest percent." 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297074 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297075 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297076 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297077 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1000 #edb/ref 17592186297078 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1041 "selection" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1104 #edb/ref 17592186297078 13194139534585 true] [17592186297073 1110 #uuid "6118ae18-c606-5e01-9621-e4392e9d3275" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297074 1034 "4%" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297074 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534585 true] [17592186297074 1111 #uuid "99dec1fb-0bcd-59ea-83ad-f427c918441e" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297075 1034 "12%" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297075 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534585 true] [17592186297075 1111 #uuid "d44d8070-6ed2-54f0-b953-74962fcef638" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297076 1034 "10%" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297076 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534585 true] [17592186297076 1111 #uuid "b5e7e894-55df-5f7c-8287-8e131c62152f" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297077 1034 "8%" 13194139534585 true] [17592186297077 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534585 true] [17592186297077 1111 #uuid "abf4d2fc-a1d3